    oe:aboutDisease oed:hyperlipidemia ;
    oe:answerText "As commonly used lipid-lowering drugs, the efficacy and safety of statins, ezetimibe, and fibrates, either alone or in combination, have rarely been systematically evaluated. Therefore, we conducted a network meta-analysis to assess their efficacy and safety in patients with hyperlipidemia."^^xsd:string ;
